Inspect the client inventory

Usage:
  olr clients show [command]

Available Commands:
  list        List every client, joining identity to observed presence
  location    Ask the network equipment which port a client is attached to

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for show

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr clients show [command] --help" for more information about a command.
